      short: 'V1 agonist: constricts the splanchnic bed and, with albumin, reverses some hepatorenal syndromes.',
      def: 'Terlipressin (V1 agonist) with albumin for hepatorenal syndrome with acute kidney injury. Noradrenaline is an alternative in the ICU.',
